_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"About `@export_dir` accepting the base directory of the files, I think \"prettifying\" this right now isn't going to be very useful since I didn't find any complaints about it means that most people use the Dialog to find their directories (based on the lack of traction the proposal got). The reason I went ahead with it anyway is because I believe it should be intended behaviour for the `@export_dir` to accept folders and reject files. I believe it should be kept as barebones as possible for now.","created_at":"2026-04-10T15:34:05Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T15:34:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118269#discussion_r3065241656","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118269","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3065241656"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118269#discussion_r3065241656"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118269"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3065241656/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":193,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3063583506,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3066731525","pull_request_review_id":4092465536,"id":3066731525,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc62ypwF","diff_hunk":"@@ -819,17 +816,24 @@ bool EditorPropertyPath::_can_drop_data_fw(const Point2 &p_point, const Varia